function getNotifConfig(type){const m={proof:{icon:"check",label:"Proof submitted"},kick:{icon:"kick",label:"Kicked"},challenge:{icon:"challenge",label:"New challenge"},follow:{icon:"follow",label:"New follower"}};return m[type]||{icon:"bell",label:type};}
